100% specificity for acute onset)", "Metabolic/Glucosuric Vomiting: Weakly supported by diabetes but contradicted by cardiac/vascular findings", "Functional Gastrointestinal Motility Disorder: Chronic constipation history conflicts with subacute GI decompensation pattern"], "alarm_features": ["Hypertensive urgency (197/128 mmHg)", "Cardiac murmur suggesting valvular pathology", "Weak peripheral pulses indicating possible systemic vascular compromise"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Gastrointestinal Obstruction (Mechanical or Functional)", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.0, "posterior": 0.3686567989530147, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.5, "evidence_for": ["The surgical scar increases adhesion risk, and chronic constipation may contribute to mechanical obstruction. This weakly supports B1 as a potential cause."], "evidence_against": ["Absence of acute peritoneal signs weakly argues against B1, but vascular findings do not definitively exclude it."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B1.1", "B1.2", "B1.3"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.9, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Chronic Constipation / Bowel Motility Disorders", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.3089143865842895, "posterior": 0.4300995987785171, "danger": 0.5, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["The subacute timeline and dietary/alcohol triggers align more with chronic motility issues (B2) than mechanical obstruction (B1), moderately supporting B2."], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.8, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.3, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "etiology", "representative_diseases": []}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Cardiogenic Causes of GI Symptoms", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.102, "danger": 0.9, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Lack of acute heart failure signs weakly argues against B3, though hypertension and aortic regurgitation still provide some support."]}, "B5": {"id": "B5", "label": "Vascular Ischemic Bowel Disease", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.045, "danger": 0.7, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Subacute presentation without acute ischemia signs weakly argues against B5, though vascular compromise remains plausible."]}, "B4": {"id": "B4", "label": "Infectious Gastroenteritis", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.053, "danger": 0.4, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": []}, "B1.1": {"id": "B1.1", "label": "Adhesional Bowel Obstruction (Post-Appendectomy)", "parent": "B1", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.1382462996073805, "posterior": 0.1382462996073805, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.2, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.3, "interrupt_relevance": 0.7, "level_role": "disease_class", "classification_axis": "anatomy", "representative_diseases": []}, "B1.2": {"id": "B1.2", "label": "Impacted Stool with Superimposed Functional Obstruction", "parent": "B1", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.11520524967281709, "posterior": 0.11520524967281709, "danger": 0.6, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.4, "interrupt_relevance": 0.5, "level_role": "disease_class", "classifica